{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bd015a4f083f9d1e","name":"The Muur Talisman","source":{"id":"source:reference-bd015a4f083f9d1e","title":"The Muur Talisman","revision":20553,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:04:29Z","sha256":"d43dc6aab664ac71c890191a0f3e77ccbbb1024f8afb84e596f572c1be7fb832","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20553","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Muur%20Talisman&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bd015a4f083f9d1e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the most dangerous artifacts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," known to have surfaced is The Muur Talisman. An ancient Sith Lord named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Karness Muur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Karness_Muur?action=edit&redlink=1"}," created The Muur Talisman long before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Hyperspace War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Hyperspace_War?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Whoever carries The Muur Talisman is filled with the power of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},". More importantly, The Muur Talisman holds the power to create and control vile creatures known as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rakghouls"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rakghouls"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Force-sensitive character wearing The Muur Talisman can infect any target within 12 squares and in their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rakghoul Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rakghoul_Disease","referenceId":"reference:9af78817854c5502"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", with no attack required. Furthermore, all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rakghouls"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rakghouls"}," have a Helpful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," toward the wearer of The Muur Talisman. In addition, The Muur Talisman stops all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aging"}," in the host.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Sith Spirit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Karness Muur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Karness_Muur?action=edit&redlink=1"}," lurks within The Muur Talisman, speaking to the wearer and urging them to spread the Muur legacy through the creation and command of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rakghouls"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rakghouls"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
